# ABP Studio

ABP Studio is the integrated development environment for ABP.

## Features
- Solution creation and management
- Module installation
- Package management
- Database migrations
- Running applications
- Kubernetes deployment
- Application monitoring

## Solution Explorer
- View and manage ABP modules
- Configure module dependencies
- Browse solution structure

## Running Applications
- Start/stop applications
- View logs
- Monitor performance

## Kubernetes Integration
- Deploy to Kubernetes
- Manage Helm charts
- Configure services
